        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amanda Brooks, Shim Hyung-rae, Jason Behr, Robert Forster, Elizabeth Peña\n- Products: D-War, Cut Off\n- Topics: film careers, film releases\n\nFacts:\n- Amanda Brooks was born on June 22, 1981.\n- Amanda Brooks is an actress who starred in the 2006 film Cut Off.\n- D-War is a 2007 South Korean action-adventure fantasy film.\n- D-War was released in North America as Dragon Wars: D-War.\n- D-War was written and directed by Shim Hyung-rae.\n- D-War stars Jason Behr, Amanda Brooks, Robert Forster, and Elizabeth Peña.\n- Amanda Brooks starred in the 2007 film D-War.",
